&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position sits in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/strong&gt; service based in London. We combine data, technology, creative content, and paid media to crack brands’ business problems &amp;amp; drive revenue through a variety of digital marketing solutions like ad campaigns, augmented reality, and chatbots. Our clients include JustEat Takeaway, The Macallan, easyJet, TikTok, and eBay.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We Build What’s Next&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands aren’t coming to us for safe bets or small optimisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They’re asking:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;How do we move culture, not just attention?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;How do we grow when the category is flat and everyone’s shouting?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;How do we turn creators into a real business driver, not a line item?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These aren’t problems you solve by tweaking last year’s plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They demand connected thinking across &lt;strong&gt;culture, creativity, data, and media&lt;/strong&gt; - and the confidence to make moves before they’re obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;DEPT®&lt;/strong&gt;, influencer marketing is a core growth discipline. Not an add-on. Not an afterthought. We design creator ecosystems that scale, adapt, and deliver measurable impact - across brand, performance, and commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the go-to person in your circle for the latest trends and buzzworthy creators? Do you find yourself glued to your phone, constantly uncovering the next big thing in the world of social media? If unique, out-of-the-box creative brand strategies are filling up most of your saves. We want you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re the friend everyone turns to for trend advice, the one who seems to have an instinctive radar for pop culture shifts. Whether it&#39;s scouting rising stars on TikTok, analysing viral moments, or brainstorming innovative ways to use creators in campaigns that defy the ordinary, your creativity knows no bounds. Join us in shaping the future of influencer at DEPT@!&amp;nbsp; We are looking for a candidate who not only possesses strong analytical and strategic skills but also has a genuine passion for Influencer Marketing and social media trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign Delivery: Utilise your expertise to ensure seamless, high-impact influencer campaign delivery. Track and optimise campaigns for strong client returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Roadmap Development: Strategically shape and evolve the client roadmap, nurturing long-term relationships while identifying reactive opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Client Relationships: Own and deepen senior client relationships, acting as a key escalation point and providing regular engagement to support Client Service &amp;amp; Creative teams in account growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Partner with Creative &amp;amp; Paid Social teams to maximise campaign performance and champion the influencer product across business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Implementation: Develop, implement, and refine guidelines and resource planning to enhance operational efficiency where necessary. Collaborate with leadership to address team challenges as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOW Management: Support wider teams to define accurate, profitable SOWs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Development: Support and develop your direct reports (3), fostering a positive and productive team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Knowledge: Maintain a strong understanding of the influencer marketing landscape, encompassing different platforms, influencer tiers, content formats, and ROI measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis Expertise: Conduct thorough data analysis to evaluate campaign performance and drive strategic decisions, ensuring insights are effectively communicated and leveraged for future initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting Proficiency: Strong reporting skills focused on influencer metrics, providing actionable insights that inform clients and elevate campaign success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of influencer campaign execution and proven experience in managing at least 2 direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience is essential for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable track record of creating and implementing high-performing influencer marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and leverage collaboration opportunities with other business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural problem solver with a proactive approach to client solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, dynamic, and engaging communicator who prioritises quality work and a positive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about developing influencer team knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immediate start availability is highly preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office, depending on location).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refreshments are provided in the office all week, as well as drinks at 4 pm on a Thursday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is part of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;services. Our team is a vibrant mix of talents, ranging from Creatives, Influencer Marketers, Brand &amp;amp; Content Strategists to Account Managers, Programmatic and Marketing Automation Consultants. Together, we blend imaginative storytelling and performance-driven strategies with cutting-edge technology to create engaging digital experiences that build lasting relationships with our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Account Director&#39;s lead on all the work we deliver for a suite of clients and they sit in our structure alongside the other ‘Heads of...’ (e.g. Media, Creative).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t believe in siloed teams – content, technology, media and data overlap in all roles. This person will oversee development of the strategy for the brands they lead, including managing a team. They will represent Dept® to our clients, adding value to relationships beyond organisational skills doing a mixture of account management and strategic planning, not your typical suit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need someone who understands our client’s customers, who can put themselves in their shoes to create strategies and ideas that exceed expectations, who understands that brands are competing for consumers’ attention and have at best a couple of seconds to inspire some sort of interaction. We need people who can come up with big ideas as well as lots of little ones that are framed in a solid strategy grounded in insight and ultimately deliver a tangible ROI for our clients. Most importantly, we need a leader who inspires their team and earns the respect of senior clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates must have experience managing teams and complex campaigns for brands and be calm and controlled in high pressure situations. Equally, experience with delivering commercial success in an agency model is important.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in partnership with senior clients to develop annual strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee teams to develop brilliant digital content (creative, production)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, line-manage, motivate and inspire your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead contract negotiations and oversee the implementation of commercial agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver and track profitable growth for your clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee deliverables from across the business (content, technology, media, data)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivery of work is to the highest possible standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure constant innovation across all deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our creative process by sharing your ideas and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee budget management for clients, including campaigns and always on activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with platforms and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present work internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete work to deadline and often under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in roles servicing clients in an agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, motivating and coaching teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large client and agency teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex TTL campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with campaign content production and budget management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a global brand&lt;/li&gt;
