&lt;p&gt;This position sits in our &lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Media &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;service based in London. We combine data, technology, creative content, and paid media to crack brands’ business problems &amp;amp; drive revenue through a variety of digital marketing solutions. Our clients include eBay, Pepsi Co., Visa and easyJet.&lt;/p&gt;
